OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA bright end
OL,6,Fto the day with sunny spells this
OL,7,Fevening. Remaining dry overnight with
OL,8,Flengthy clear spells across the
OL,9,Fregion. Rather chilly, particularly in
OL,10,Frural spots, with a few fog patches
OL,11,Fforming towards dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FDry and settled for most on
OL,14,FSunday, with plenty of late August
OL,15,Fsunshine on offer. Light winds and
OL,16,Ffeeling warm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
