OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FRemaining largely dry with sunny
OL,7,Fspells on Monday. Showers and possibly
OL,8,Fthunderstorms developing on Tuesday,
OL,9,Fthese becoming more widespread and
OL,10,Fheavier by Wednesday. Feeling warmer,
OL,11,Fespecially in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
